BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-a-home-i-imagine@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T200000Z
SUMMARY:A Home I Imagine
DESCRIPTION:A home can begin as an idea and take shape in many forms. In this workshop\, imagination leads the design process. Through drawing\, building\, and assembling materials\, children develop their own vision of a home and translate it into a tangible model. Each creation results in a constructed home that reflects personal ideas and vision.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-a-home-i-imagine.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-built-by-nature@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Built by Nature
DESCRIPTION:A bird&rsquo\;s nest\, a termite mound\, a shell\, each one is carefully built\, not by chance\, but by need. In this workshop\, children observe how living things design their homes\, then borrow these ideas to sketch and shape their own. Openings for air\, layers for protection\, and smart use of materials begin to appear in their designs. What starts in nature slowly turns into a built form.
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-built-by-nature.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-my-family-bouquet@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T200000Z
SUMMARY:My Family Bouquet
DESCRIPTION:A bouquet grows\, one flower at a time. In this hands-on workshop\, children begin with simple shapes and watch them take form as each piece is rolled\, combined\, and built into a flower. Colors are chosen\, details are added\, and the process repeats\, each new bloom adding to the whole. As the bouquet comes together\, each flower stands for someone at home\, gathered into one arrangement shaped through making and choice.
LOCATION:Ithra - Plaza
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-my-family-bouquet.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-treasures-in-every-home@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Treasures in Every Home
DESCRIPTION:Deep within the Earth\, metal begins its journey\, formed over time and transformed into materials we use every day at home. In this interactive workshop\, children follow this journey\, then reshape a simple tin container into a new functional object. The activity introduces how materials can be reused and redesigned for new purposes..
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-treasures-in-every-home.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-my-neighbor-totoro@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T140000Z
DTEND:20260722T160000Z
SUMMARY:My Neighbor Totoro
DESCRIPTION:A gentle and magical tale by Studio Ghibli that celebrates the innocence of childhood\, the quiet beauty of nature\, and the meaning of home found in family. Through the eyes of two sisters who move to the countryside\, the story unfolds into a world of forest spirits and unseen friends.
LOCATION:Ithra - Cinema
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-my-neighbor-totoro.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-kindergarten-under-the-palm-tree-english@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260711T080000Z
DTEND:20260725T083000Z
SUMMARY:Kindergarten Under the Palm Tree (English)
DESCRIPTION:Produced by the King Abdulaziz Center for World Culture (Ithra)\, a new animated series makes its debut! Set in the diverse environments of Saudi Arabia\, small animals embark on charming adventures\, discovering the meaning of early emotions such as gratitude and joy in a warm world designed for young children.
LOCATION:Ithra - Cinema
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-kindergarten-under-the-palm-tree-english.html
END:VEVENT
