UID:event-night-at-ithra@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260712T150000Z
DTEND:20260726T190000Z
SUMMARY:Night at Ithra
DESCRIPTION:An exclusive family experience for Ithra members. Imagine Ithra transformed into a living\, breathing home\, where footsteps soften and a new experience begins. &ldquo\;A Night at Ithra&rdquo\; is an immersive evening for families to explore a range of curated spaces across Ithra. The program moves through key locations including the Children&rsquo\;s Museum\, library\, theater\, museum\, and outdoor areas\, with each stop offering a different activity or perspective. The evening concludes with a shared meal and an optional film screening. Designed for families with children aged 7 and above.
LOCATION:Ithra - Assorted Locations
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-night-at-ithra.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-natures-architects@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260713T130000Z
DTEND:20260718T180000Z
SUMMARY:Nature's Architects
DESCRIPTION:Nature builds without blueprints\, yet every structure serves a clear purpose. The experience begins with a short film that reveals how living organisms design and construct their homes. This is followed by hands-on activities where children explore these ideas further\, testing\, building\, and observing how form responds to need. The workshop connects observation with practical understanding.
LOCATION:Ithra - Energy Exhibit
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-natures-architects.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-finding-nemo@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260713T140000Z
DTEND:20260718T183000Z
SUMMARY:Finding Nemo
DESCRIPTION:Everything changes when a father clownfish loses his son in a single moment\, setting off on a journey across vast distances and endless dangers. Amid the ocean&rsquo\;s shifting waves\, the search becomes a test that reveals the strength of family bonds that never break\, no matter how far apart they are.
LOCATION:Ithra - Cinema
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-finding-nemo.html
