DTEND:20260725T160000Z
SUMMARY:The Lorax
DESCRIPTION:In a world where trees have disappeared\, a young boy named Ted goes on a journey to discover a real tree. Along the way\, he encounters the Lorax\, a guardian who speaks on behalf of the trees. This leads to a journey that reveals the importance of protecting nature and caring for the environment.
